---
const { locale = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
---
<aside class="website-notice" aria-label={zh ? '网站用途与工作单位' : 'Website purpose and clinical role'}>
<p class="notice-summary">{zh ? '个人专业介绍与心理健康教育。本网站不提供临床服务，也不接受预约或付款。' : 'Personal profile & mental health education. This website does not provide clinical services or accept appointments or payments.'}</p>
<details><summary>{zh ? '网站用途与诊所信息' : 'Website purpose & clinic information'}</summary>
<p>{zh ? 'Reminiscence Cloud 是 Sharon Miao 的个人网站，并非独立心理咨询执业机构。本网站不提供临床服务，不接受预约、咨询或付款。' : 'Reminiscence Cloud is Sharon Miao’s personal website, not a separate psychotherapy practice. This website does not provide clinical services or accept appointments, consultations, or payments.'}</p>
<p>{zh ? 'Sharon Miao 目前在 Mind & Body Garden Psychology 担任 Psychotherapist（心理咨询师）。有关临床工作或预约，请通过该诊所的官方渠道联系诊所。' : 'Sharon Miao works as a Psychotherapist at Mind & Body Garden Psychology. For clinical inquiries or appointments, please contact the clinic through its official channels.'}</p>
<p>{zh ? '本网站由个人维护，并非 Mind & Body Garden Psychology 的官方网站。教育内容不能替代个体化心理健康照护。' : 'This personally maintained website is not an official website of Mind & Body Garden Psychology. Educational content is not a substitute for individualized mental health care.'}</p>
</details>
</aside>
<style>
.website-notice{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 28px;color:#4c5c6b;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65;border-bottom:1px solid #d7e1e5}
.website-notice p{margin:0}.website-notice details p{max-width:940px;margin:12px 0}.website-notice summary{cursor:pointer;width:fit-content;font-weight:500;text-underline-offset:4px;margin-top:6px}.website-notice summary:hover{text-decoration:underline}.website-notice summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #3f6183;outline-offset:4px}
@media(max-width:600px){.website-notice{padding:16px 22px;font-size:.8rem}}
</style>
